# Game UI Improvements — Implementation Plan

## Issues to Fix

1. **Bank & Merchant buttons are dead** — currently `// TODO` placeholders
2. **No player profile display** — no name, country, credit score visible
3. **Portrait mode** → **Force landscape** for better farm visibility
4. **Plain background** → Dynamic sky gradient + weather visuals (clouds, sun, rain)

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Force Landscape Orientation

#### [MODIFY] [main.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/main.dart)

Add `SystemChrome.setPreferredOrientations([DeviceOrientation.landscapeLeft, DeviceOrientation.landscapeRight])` in [main()](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/test/widget_test.dart#5-59) before `runApp`.

---

### 2. Dynamic Sky Background

#### [NEW] [sky_painter.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/engine/sky_painter.dart)

A `CustomPainter` that draws behind the farm grid:
- **Day sky**: Blue gradient with animated clouds (white `drawRRect` shapes drifting)
- **Sunset**: Orange/purple gradient (based on time of day)
- **Rain**: Dark grey sky + rain particle overlay
- **Storm**: Near-black sky + lightning flashes
- **Drought**: Harsh yellow/orange tint + heat shimmer

The sky will reflect the current weather state from `GameState.activeDisaster`.

#### [MODIFY] [game_screen.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/screens/game_screen.dart)

Stack `SkyPainter` behind the isometric grid `CustomPaint`.

---

### 3. Bank Screen

#### [NEW] [bank_screen.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/screens/bank_screen.dart)

Modal bottom sheet or full-screen overlay with tabs:
- **Register Bank** — opens bank account (if not registered)
- **Deposit/Withdraw** — transfer between cash ↔ bank
- **Apply for Loan** — input amount + term, shows monthly payment preview, calls loan logic
- **Buy Insurance** — select a farm plot, pay premium, get coverage
- **Credit Score** — shows current score + factors

---

### 4. Merchant Screen (BNPL)

#### [NEW] [merchant_screen.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/screens/merchant_screen.dart)

Equipment shop with BNPL:
- **Equipment catalog** (Tractor, Irrigation System, Greenhouse) with prices
- **Buy with Cash** or **BNPL** (3 or 6 month installments)
- Shows installment breakdown + warning about late fees
- Active BNPL plans list with payment status

---

### 5. Player Profile in HUD

#### [MODIFY] [hud_overlay.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/widgets/hud_overlay.dart)

Add to the top bar:
- Player name + country flag emoji
- Bank registered status badge
- Credit score indicator (color-coded: red/yellow/green)

Rearrange layout for landscape (top bar spans full width, action buttons on right edge).

---

### 6. Wire HUD Buttons to Screens

#### [MODIFY] [hud_overlay.dart](file:///c:/Users/User/Desktop/Project/BorneoHack/mobile-games/lib/widgets/hud_overlay.dart)

Replace the `// TODO` in Bank and Merchant button `onPressed` with `Navigator.push` to the new screens.

---

## Verification

1. `flutter analyze` — no issues
2. Run on device in **landscape** mode
3. Tap Bank button → Bank screen opens with loan/insurance options
4. Tap Merchant button → Merchant screen opens with BNPL equipment
5. Sky gradient visible behind grid, changes with disaster state
6. Player name + credit score visible in HUD
